          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What does hemp protein taste like?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Buyers commonly describe unflavored hemp protein as earthy, nutty or grassy, with a gritty texture and a green-brown color. It tastes far better blended into smoothies with banana, berries, cocoa or nut butter, or stirred into oats, than mixed with plain water. If you dislike the taste, mix a smaller amount with a flavored pea or plant blend."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is hemp protein safe?",
